! UHF def2-SVP CHELPG

# Open-shell water cation: a doublet, so ORCA prints the "... AND SPIN POPULATIONS"
# variants of the Mulliken and Loewdin tables as well as the plain charge tables.
# Hirshfeld is requested explicitly; CHELPG above adds the CHELPG charge table.
%output
  Print[P_Hirshfeld] 1
end

*xyz 1 2
O   0.0000000   0.0000000   0.1173000
H   0.0000000   0.7572000  -0.4692000
H   0.0000000  -0.7572000  -0.4692000
*
